    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you aren't a doctor but i cant get a hold of his pediatrician right now and the office is closed since its the weekend. i dont want to take him to the er if its just a heat rash or some kind of virus. is there any way i can tell from the look of them if it's something serious or if i can just give him some tylenol and wait until monday to see the doctor?",
